  "scope": "Product group-successor operation/reservation selection, inherited-context forwarding, group frame assembly and final admission now live in the adapter. The same original VM builder retains identity generation, lowering and a single fuel debit. Initial and capture successors share the delegate without changing evaluation, pair checks or native journals.",
